              "width": "fit_content",
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "说明",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13.0,
              "fontWeight": 600,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#111827"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4407",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 按客户价值排，规则同今日待办（经营等级 → 潜力等级 → 金额档）；预计付款日已过的用红字标出。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4408",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 已收 / 未收取收款管理里关联这张 PI 的到账金额；水单取 PI 附件。业务员不用在这里重复登记。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4409",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 预计付款：记跟进时填「客户说哪天付」，或按 PI 付款条款带出（如尾款「发货前」）。没有日期的每 2 天提醒一次，可在系统参数里改。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4410",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 部分到账（如 30% 定金）仍留在列表，下一步自动建议「通知采购备货」「发货前催尾款」。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4411",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 客户明确不付或取消：在记跟进里选「未成交」+ 原因（按 SOP 字典），PI 作废走原有流程。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
