        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "n4837",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6.0,
          "padding": [
            14.0,
            18.0
          ],
          "cornerRadius": 10.0,
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#FFFBEB"
            }
          ],
          "stroke": {
            "thickness": 1.0,
            "fill": [
              {
                "type": "solid",
                "color": "#FDE68A"
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4838",
              "width": "fit_content",
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "说明",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13.0,
              "fontWeight": 600,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#111827"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4839",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 排序：先按资格评级（A→B→C→D，D2 资格判断时评），再按潜力等级，最后按询盘预估价值档；还没有成交，所以没有经营等级。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4840",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 开发阶段 D1–D7 由业务员在记跟进时勾选推进；D1 目标市场和 D2 资格判断沿用客户档案的 AI 背调，背调完成自动给出资格评级。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4841",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 阶段分三组：找客户（D1–D2）、找人触达（D3–D5）、挖需求（D6–D7），可以点全部、分组或单个阶段。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4842",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 「触达」是记过的有效触达次数；序列发完仍无回复的，提示转培育（需确认），到期自动回到今日待办。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n4843",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 转为商机后，这条开发记录结束，客户在链路上移到「商机成交」，原有聊天和背调在客户详情的时间线里都能看到。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
