              "content": "说明",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13.0,
              "fontWeight": 600,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#111827"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5286",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 排序同其他板块：经营等级 → 潜力等级 → 订单金额档。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5287",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 履约进度 6 段：F1 订单确认 → F2 采购下单 → F3 供应跟进 → F4 到货验收 → F5 包装发货 → F6 物流跟踪；SOP 的 F7 客户签收合并到「售后评价 · 签收确认」，避免重复跟进。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5288",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 进度都从现有单据自动带出：收款到账 → F1，采购单 → F2/F3，入库验收 → F4，出库发货 → F5，物流轨迹 → F6。延误或物流异常的行显示橙色。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5289",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 系统只在 4 个节点提醒业务员和客户沟通：订单确认、交期确认、验收照片（有特殊要求时）、发货和异常。其余节点不打扰。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
