                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5698",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 签收 → A1 自动生成；A2 使用确认在签收后 7 天提醒；A3/A4 有问题时点「建售后单」，直接用现有售后单流程，进度在这里同步显示。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5699",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· A5 满意度确认只在没有未关闭售后单时出现；客户明确满意才进 A6 邀请评价，评价状态（已邀请 / 已评价 / 婉拒）记在订单上。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n5700",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· A7 案例沉淀放在售后单关闭时可选填，不单独占一步；售后结束客户在链路上移到「客户经营」。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
