              {
                "type": "solid",
                "color": "#FDE68A"
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6093",
              "width": "fit_content",
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "说明",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 13.0,
              "fontWeight": 600,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#111827"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6094",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 排序：经营等级 → 潜力等级 → 近 12 个月成交额档。经营等级、潜力等级沿用客户档案（每晚 02:30 重算）。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6095",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 联系节奏按经营等级：S 每 7 天、A 每 14 天、B 每 30 天、C 每 60 天，可在系统参数里改；超期的标红并进今日待办。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6096",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 采购规律由系统按历史订单推测（周期、品类、季节），只作参考，旁边注明「系统推测」；数据不足时不显示建议。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6097",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· G1 客户分层、G2 客户档案、G3 采购规律识别由系统自动完成（经营等级、档案完整度、规律推测），不占跟进列表；列表从 G4 需求挖掘开始。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6098",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 「复购机会」来自记跟进时勾的「客户有新需求」或客户直接发来的询盘。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6099",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 「沉睡」= 超过两个联系周期没有任何互动；「全部老客户」不按节奏筛，方便查找。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6100",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 老客户不建商机（商机只记新客户获客）：新需求建询盘后，在商机成交里按单据推导阶段（询盘 → 报价 S4 → 记跟进 S5/S6 → PI S7）；一个客户可以同时出现在商机成交和客户经营里（老客户有新单在谈）。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
