            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6724",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 一次填完：情况、卡点、下一步、日期都在这里，保存即更新商机阶段、待办提醒和客户档案，业务员不用到各处分别改。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6725",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· AI 只做建议，所有字段都可改；不粘贴也能点「或者只记一下」的快捷项三秒记完（只记事实，下一步按 SOP 默认节奏）。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6726",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 勾「客户给了反馈」→ S5，勾「客户在谈条件」→ S6；勾「没回复」时连续第 3 次无回复会提示考虑转培育。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6727",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 这里没有手动赢单，赢单只由收款到账自动触发。明确丢单时点「更多 › 标为未成交」并选 SOP 原因。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6728",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 档案补充只写入勾选项，已有值不覆盖，改动记入客户档案的变更记录。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
